    {{!-- About the site --}}
    <section class="about-section">
        <div class="container container--narrow">
            <div class="about-card about-card--featured">
                <div class="about-card__label">What is Juniper Finance?</div>
                <p>This is where I put my actual research — not summaries, not takes, but proper data-driven analysis on housing, markets, and economic policy. Every post is built from primary sources: Fed data, BLS releases, SEC filings, whatever it takes to get the numbers right.</p>
                <p>I started this because I kept doing this kind of work for fun and figured I might as well publish it. If you're into the numbers behind the news, you're in the right place.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

